---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/mainLayout.astro";
import './src/styles/global.css';
---

<MainLayout>
	<h1 class="font-display">Hi, I'm Oli!</h1>
	<p class="text-bg-dark dark:text-bg-light">GitHub: <a class="hover:underline cursor-pointer" href="https://github.com/what-does-that-do" target="_blank">@what-does-that-do</a></p>
	<p>I'm student software developer based near Cambridge, UK.</p>
	<p>Usually you'll find me solving a niche problem, creating a hacky project with a Raspberry Pi, coding a solution to something, building a model railway, volunteering at the <a href="https://suffolkhedgehoghospital.com" target="_blank">Suffolk Hedgehog Hospital</a> or <a href="https://robocon.uk/news/robocon-2025-review/" target="_blank">playing with robots</a> (ex-RoboCon leader).</p>
	<p>Why "what-does-that-do"? Well, I enjoy solving problems through code and electronics, but most importantly asking 'what does this do', unafraid to fall down a rabbit hole never to return...</p>
</MainLayout>
